WEBVTT

00:03.350 --> 00:05.920
What is the reason of my birth?

00:06.100 --> 00:10.030
Reason of my life, question of man.

00:10.040 --> 00:13.630
What he is?

00:13.820 --> 00:18.210
What he wants?

00:21.880 --> 00:29.290
Ima kimi ni mienai chikara ga osoi.
Now you are being troubled by an unseen power.

00:29.290 --> 00:34.360
Utsumuite namida kakushiteta.
You hang your head and hide your tears.

00:36.640 --> 00:43.620
Dou sureba ii ka? Sore sae wakarazu ni!
What should be done? That's unknown!

00:44.040 --> 00:51.490
Asphalt ni saku hana ni yuuki kanjita...
Blooming in the asphalt is a flower of courage...

00:53.290 --> 00:56.780
Itsumo kimi no soba ni iru yo.
We'll always be by your side.

00:57.000 --> 01:00.290
Da kara mou hitori ja nai.
So you're not alone anymore.

01:00.640 --> 01:04.140
Kimi ga michi ni mayou toki wa...
When you lose your way...

01:04.360 --> 01:07.720
Boku ga saki o aruku yo.
I'll walk ahead and lead you.

01:08.020 --> 01:11.550
Tooi sora koete...
Crossing to the far away sky...

01:11.750 --> 01:15.100
Bokura wa tobitatsu!
We're flying!

01:15.420 --> 01:18.940
Kitto soko ni aru...
It'll definitely be there...

01:18.940 --> 01:23.850
Sore ga kimi no yume
Your dream...

01:30.370 --> 01:34.990
Denkou

01:53.680 --> 01:55.150
Who... Who's there?

02:09.270 --> 02:12.070
You shouldn't be asleep there.

02:18.740 --> 02:20.920
So what do you have to say
Professor Ochanomizu?

02:21.250 --> 02:23.540
About the Sakuya museum incident?

02:23.660 --> 02:28.740
Hmmm, the only one in the world
capable of that is Denkou.

02:29.090 --> 02:34.900
Denkou is a robot that
has the ability to disappear.

02:35.470 --> 02:40.930
So, did you hear about the incident
in Professor Emil's lab half a year ago?

02:47.230 --> 02:52.210
That's right, the one responsible
was that big villain, Skunk.

02:53.570 --> 02:55.770
Enough talk, hurry, to the lab.

02:55.790 --> 02:58.330
Professor, use Atom please.

02:58.960 --> 03:03.600
Even Atom can't see
through Denkou's shield.

03:03.840 --> 03:08.320
Also, for now I don't want
to involve Atom in the incident.

03:08.900 --> 03:11.940
Today is his first day at school.

03:12.220 --> 03:13.320
School?!

03:13.600 --> 03:15.530
Atom is a robot you know!

03:15.680 --> 03:16.380
Of course.

03:17.100 --> 03:19.780
However, he has the mind of 9 year old boy.

03:20.060 --> 03:24.860
That boy should be
with children his own age.

03:26.150 --> 03:30.240
This is your new classmate, Atom.

03:30.500 --> 03:32.880
I'm Atom. Nice to meet you all.

03:33.590 --> 03:36.820
Atom? With kids? Our classmate?

03:38.430 --> 03:39.220
Atom.

03:39.260 --> 03:40.140
Y-yes.

03:40.820 --> 03:43.210
Today let's have a class
that most the kids like.

03:43.500 --> 03:46.530
Alright everyone, let's begin class.

03:51.840 --> 03:54.930
Why is a robot coming to school?

03:55.400 --> 04:00.290
My dad says that robots are tools
made to work for humans.

04:00.410 --> 04:04.220
That's wrong,
humans and robots can be friends.

04:05.150 --> 04:09.130
For me, I'd much rather have
a human than a robot friend.

04:15.950 --> 04:18.340
There you are! Atom!

04:18.340 --> 04:23.240
Your arms are hard, your legs are hard,
your hair's hard too! wow!

04:23.250 --> 04:26.070
I'm Tamao, but call me Tama-chan.

04:26.110 --> 04:28.030
Tama-chan? Nice to meet you.

04:28.190 --> 04:31.080
You smiled! Atom has feelings!

04:31.300 --> 04:34.490
Of course, Atom is the latest type of robot.

04:34.660 --> 04:36.070
Oh yeah.

04:37.240 --> 04:39.890
Tama having a robot friend is very fitting.

04:43.000 --> 04:45.520
Hey, hang with me during class.

04:46.060 --> 04:48.290
We're going to be doing
something really interesting.

04:48.290 --> 04:49.140
Really?

04:49.210 --> 04:49.780
Let's go!

04:49.780 --> 04:50.580
Okay.

04:54.470 --> 04:56.310
Oh, I forgot my bag.

04:58.230 --> 04:59.930
How strange...

04:59.960 --> 05:00.440
Here.

05:00.460 --> 05:02.020
Thank you!

05:04.900 --> 05:06.170
Who was that just now?

05:07.970 --> 05:10.770
Everyone, gather in the middle please.

05:11.830 --> 05:14.210
Okay, let's begin where
we left off last week.

05:24.190 --> 05:25.700
Tama, this is?

05:26.530 --> 05:27.910
Isn't it neat?

05:30.980 --> 05:34.050
The whole history class is a hologram.

05:34.610 --> 05:35.920
Atom, look!

05:36.330 --> 05:37.920
Up there.

05:41.890 --> 05:46.930
When people traveled on the sea,
what moved the boat was the sea wind.

05:47.280 --> 05:52.190
The crew, like the wind,
freely managed the ship.

05:52.360 --> 05:53.850
But sometimes...

05:55.940 --> 05:58.690
...weather like this would occur.

06:02.480 --> 06:06.290
Hey hey hey, don't pull, hey!

06:09.900 --> 06:13.550
My arm! Something's hanging onto it!

06:14.440 --> 06:15.920
Watch out!

06:20.700 --> 06:21.660
What?

06:23.520 --> 06:24.860
A ghost!

06:25.430 --> 06:29.070
Everyone, calm down... I mean, a ghost...

06:34.310 --> 06:37.470
That ghost is definitely after me.

06:37.660 --> 06:40.210
Atom, please beat it up if it shows up again.

06:40.250 --> 06:40.880
Okay.

06:41.160 --> 06:44.960
I thought you said you'd rather have
a human rather than a robot friend.

06:46.830 --> 06:49.110
No way! I think something's following!

06:49.310 --> 06:50.860
Nothing's there.

06:51.000 --> 06:52.710
You're really up a tree.

06:53.010 --> 06:55.440
Wait, something's really coming.

07:02.450 --> 07:05.110
I can't see anything, it must be hidden.

07:09.260 --> 07:10.830
You noticed me!

07:11.270 --> 07:14.240
Aw... You found me...

07:21.520 --> 07:22.670
You're...

07:23.130 --> 07:25.520
I'm called Denkou.

07:25.770 --> 07:27.230
You're a robot?

07:27.340 --> 07:31.070
Could it be that you were the one
pulling on Shibugaki's arm in school?

07:31.510 --> 07:35.180
At the time,
I was surprised because he pulled back.

07:35.490 --> 07:38.500
After that,
Shibugaki seemed kind of down so...

07:39.530 --> 07:40.640
I see!

07:40.800 --> 07:44.210
Denkou, you were worried about
Shibugaki so you followed us.

07:44.350 --> 07:45.160
Yeah...

07:45.540 --> 07:46.980
Y-you...

07:47.250 --> 07:48.940
So you're a good guy?

07:49.070 --> 07:51.360
Denkou, why'd you come to our school?

07:52.120 --> 07:56.920
Because I thought there'd be a LOT of kids.
I thought it might be kinda fun.

07:57.010 --> 08:00.150
Wasn't that cool?
Earlier on that boat powered by the wind?

08:00.290 --> 08:01.840
You liked the boat?

08:01.840 --> 08:02.730
Yeah.

08:03.410 --> 08:05.780
Then let me show you something good.

08:12.050 --> 08:15.950
This is my vessel. I named it the Captain-go.

08:15.950 --> 08:17.240
It's an Air-pedal.

08:17.240 --> 08:18.830
It even has a sail!

08:21.940 --> 08:24.880
Denkou don't, this is only for looking.

08:25.320 --> 08:27.330
Doesn't this air-pedal fly?

08:27.450 --> 08:30.850
Because it's remodeled
the pedals are too heavy.

08:30.950 --> 08:34.130
If you don't put in enough
energy it won't move.

08:34.140 --> 08:35.530
What the heck?

08:35.530 --> 08:38.030
But, if everyone works together, perhaps...

08:38.030 --> 08:39.200
Yeah, right?

08:40.660 --> 08:42.550
1... 2...

08:45.810 --> 08:47.390
What horrible pedals!

08:47.530 --> 08:49.800
Why not have Atom fly while carrying it?

08:49.890 --> 08:51.960
If we did that,
there'd be no use for having a sail.

08:51.980 --> 08:53.180
Do your best!

08:53.250 --> 08:54.250
Alright!

09:01.860 --> 09:03.580
Alright, I'm going to do it too!

09:11.850 --> 09:13.050
We're moving!

09:20.110 --> 09:22.230
Denkou, pull the left handle!

09:22.230 --> 09:22.960
Okay.

09:27.070 --> 09:28.790
And that right lever.

09:30.840 --> 09:32.650
Look, a flag!

09:32.650 --> 09:34.300
It's a captain's hat.

09:34.300 --> 09:36.240
Wow, it's so cool!

09:54.300 --> 09:57.230
Alright, from here on
everyone is this ship's crew.

09:57.530 --> 10:00.480
Atom, Ken, even Shibugaki...

10:00.480 --> 10:03.040
As well as Denkou, you too.

10:03.040 --> 10:04.090
Me too?

10:04.090 --> 10:07.160
Right, everyone is a part
of the Captain-go's crew.

10:07.160 --> 10:08.200
Alright!

10:11.860 --> 10:13.210
That sure was fun!

10:13.210 --> 10:14.600
Yeah, let's do it again sometime.

10:14.600 --> 10:16.430
Yeah.

10:19.840 --> 10:24.030
Those are parade decorations,
tomorrow there's going to be a festival.

10:25.680 --> 10:28.460
Hey, let's go to tomorrow's
festival all together.

10:28.460 --> 10:30.180
Nice idea, what do you think Atom?

10:30.180 --> 10:30.820
Yeah.

10:30.820 --> 10:31.910
Denkou?

10:32.330 --> 10:33.720
Me too?

10:33.720 --> 10:37.100
Of course, you're also a part
of the Captain-go's crew.

10:37.140 --> 10:38.660
Let's go Denkou!

10:38.760 --> 10:40.210
Okay, I'm coming.

10:40.380 --> 10:41.110
Later!

10:41.140 --> 10:42.420
See you tomorrow!

10:42.800 --> 10:44.610
Denkou, where do you live?

10:44.700 --> 10:47.440
Well, that's a secret.

10:47.560 --> 10:48.570
Why?

10:48.650 --> 10:51.970
Skunk said so.
"Don't tell anyone" he said.

10:51.970 --> 10:53.160
Skunk?

10:53.160 --> 10:54.820
Yeah. Well later!

10:59.380 --> 11:00.880
Skunk?

11:12.620 --> 11:16.180
You got quite a lot Denkou.

11:16.290 --> 11:18.390
Hey, can I have some?

11:18.550 --> 11:24.870
Alright, of course you should get
your share for your work.

11:29.290 --> 11:30.730
Really Robita?

11:30.730 --> 11:33.390
Yeah, I heard from Inspector Tawashi.

11:33.470 --> 11:38.700
He said some villain Skunk is using
an invisible robot to do crimes.

11:38.780 --> 11:39.950
Skunk?!

11:40.130 --> 11:43.670
Robita, this Skunk person,
what kind of person is he?!

11:43.770 --> 11:46.210
Eh, who is he? Wait a moment.

11:47.050 --> 11:48.240
Let's see...

11:49.020 --> 11:53.950
Got it! This man Skunk
is an international criminal.

11:54.490 --> 11:58.440
He's stolen so much that
it's not all counted up even now.

11:58.800 --> 11:59.940
Oh no!

12:04.800 --> 12:06.490
What if Denkou is....

12:10.600 --> 12:11.740
Denkou!

12:13.370 --> 12:14.740
Denkou, you...

12:14.740 --> 12:15.630
Look!

12:16.410 --> 12:17.320
This is?

12:17.320 --> 12:19.160
I got it at a store just now.

12:19.160 --> 12:20.420
You got it?

12:20.420 --> 12:23.510
I thought I'd some to everyone. Here.

12:26.450 --> 12:30.010
Taking someone's stuff
without telling them is wrong.

12:30.040 --> 12:31.080
Why?

12:31.210 --> 12:33.660
Skunk complements me for it though.

12:33.780 --> 12:37.040
Tomorrow I'm getting Solomon's crown.

12:37.040 --> 12:38.950
No, doing those things are wrong!

12:38.950 --> 12:40.290
But Skunk...

12:40.290 --> 12:42.690
Skunk is a really bad guy!

12:42.730 --> 12:46.410
Skunk is using you like a tool for his evil plans.

12:46.740 --> 12:47.780
Why?

12:48.810 --> 12:50.960
Why are you picking on me for?

12:50.960 --> 12:52.640
No, I'm not...

12:52.640 --> 12:55.280
I like everyone...

12:55.280 --> 12:57.160
I thought everyone would be happy.

12:57.160 --> 12:58.410
That's why...

12:58.670 --> 13:00.600
That's why I brought these stones...

13:00.660 --> 13:01.870
Denkou!

13:03.350 --> 13:04.860
Denkou, wait!

13:10.790 --> 13:12.120
Denkou...

13:23.310 --> 13:25.410
What happened?

13:26.190 --> 13:28.880
What's wrong?
Can't I talk to other people?

13:28.890 --> 13:30.100
Of course!

13:30.100 --> 13:31.850
Especially that Atom...

13:31.850 --> 13:33.180
Hey wait.

13:33.300 --> 13:34.470
Boss...

13:34.490 --> 13:37.840
Skunk, did I do something wrong...

13:38.580 --> 13:42.170
Atom was just making fun of Denkou
since he knows you're a good kid.

13:42.170 --> 13:43.190
I see

13:43.190 --> 13:46.530
Right, so why don't you
go upstairs and relax.

13:46.530 --> 13:48.500
Okay, good night.

13:50.090 --> 13:52.050
Robots...

13:52.050 --> 13:53.660
Boss, tomorrow's plan...

13:53.660 --> 13:55.210
...is going as planned.

13:55.810 --> 13:59.960
There's nothing in this world
like Solomon's crown.

14:00.630 --> 14:02.910
Once I have it...

14:03.090 --> 14:05.460
...then Denkou's use will be at an end.

14:14.040 --> 14:16.290
Denkou's after the Solomon jewels?

14:16.460 --> 14:18.040
We have to stop Denkou!

14:18.040 --> 14:19.960
Alright, let's go to the museum!

14:19.960 --> 14:23.570
No, Denkou will be with Skunk,
it'd be dangerous.

14:23.570 --> 14:25.460
But we have to do something!

14:25.510 --> 14:28.950
If everyone went,
I'm sure Denkou would understand.

14:28.960 --> 14:29.960
Atom!

14:30.110 --> 14:31.590
Okay, let's go.

14:56.870 --> 14:59.930
Atom and company are going
to the Chuu museum.

14:59.970 --> 15:01.640
The Chuu museum?

15:02.000 --> 15:03.360
Everyone go!

15:03.460 --> 15:06.770
If there's any resistance, destroy Denkou!

15:14.660 --> 15:15.690
Denkou!

15:16.400 --> 15:17.440
Denkou!

15:17.510 --> 15:18.430
Denkou!

15:18.430 --> 15:20.820
Please show yourself!

15:22.120 --> 15:23.090
Everyone!

15:23.250 --> 15:24.290
Stop it!

15:24.330 --> 15:26.220
Robots shouldn't do that!

15:26.280 --> 15:28.430
Sorry, I have to go.

15:31.310 --> 15:33.230
That's far enough Denkou!

15:33.400 --> 15:37.240
This is polarized light,
your shield won't work!

15:37.370 --> 15:41.270
Come quietly,
if you resist we will destroy you!

15:41.270 --> 15:42.240
Wait!

15:42.300 --> 15:44.040
Wait, don't fire please!

15:44.100 --> 15:46.700
It's okay, even if they fired I'd be okay!

15:46.700 --> 15:49.130
I was given a guard belt!

15:55.760 --> 15:56.780
That's...

15:57.180 --> 15:58.930
Denkou, that's a bomb!

15:58.930 --> 15:59.860
What?

16:01.790 --> 16:04.470
No, Skunk said...

16:04.590 --> 16:05.650
Denkou!

16:05.760 --> 16:06.860
Stay away!

16:06.910 --> 16:10.630
If I bring it,
Skunk promised to reward me.

16:10.670 --> 16:12.840
I want that reward!

16:12.850 --> 16:13.720
Wait!

16:13.720 --> 16:14.620
Fire!

16:20.920 --> 16:22.010
Denkou!

16:22.010 --> 16:23.080
Follow!

16:36.540 --> 16:37.800
Skunk!

16:37.970 --> 16:40.100
Oh Denkou, well done!

16:42.080 --> 16:44.300
Skunk, I did it

16:44.300 --> 16:46.390
Well done, well done!

16:46.400 --> 16:50.080
As promised could I have my reward now.

16:50.130 --> 16:52.350
Of course...

16:55.930 --> 16:57.330
What's that?

16:57.480 --> 17:00.600
Sorry, but that's a bomb.

17:01.140 --> 17:05.160
It's set to blow in 15 minutes.

17:06.990 --> 17:08.630
Farewell Denkou.

17:12.630 --> 17:14.980
W-wait! Skunk!

17:16.610 --> 17:21.540
Why?! I did what you wanted.
I was a good kid!

17:30.680 --> 17:33.330
Stop! You won't get away!

17:33.650 --> 17:37.460
Instead of catching me,
you should be catching Denkou.

17:37.560 --> 17:40.210
If you don't at 8 everything will be vaporized.

17:40.210 --> 17:41.130
What?

17:41.130 --> 17:44.120
What if within the festival
a bomb were to go off?

17:44.390 --> 17:46.150
There'll be an explosion at 8 o'clock!

17:46.330 --> 17:47.460
Explosion?!

17:49.930 --> 17:51.750
I've got less than 15 minutes.

17:57.430 --> 17:59.500
It's no good, I can't get it off.

17:59.720 --> 18:01.160
Who's there?

18:03.070 --> 18:04.380
He's here!

18:09.810 --> 18:13.460
Why? Why's everyone want to destroy me?

18:14.800 --> 18:16.330
Denkou!

18:16.940 --> 18:18.300
Denkou!

18:18.550 --> 18:20.010
Denkou!

18:20.170 --> 18:21.530
Denkou!

18:22.210 --> 18:23.510
Found him Atom!

18:23.510 --> 18:24.440
Denkou!

18:27.010 --> 18:28.230
Denkou!

18:32.690 --> 18:34.060
Denkou!

18:34.490 --> 18:35.760
Denkou!

18:35.850 --> 18:37.400
Denkou!

18:38.790 --> 18:40.100
Stop!

18:43.380 --> 18:44.900
Hey, stop!

18:54.950 --> 18:57.290
Hey! What are you doing?!

18:59.080 --> 19:00.910
Huh, hey, stop!

19:13.390 --> 19:15.960
What you're doing is wrong!

19:17.440 --> 19:18.580
Destroy!

19:19.420 --> 19:21.050
Farewell Denkou...

19:24.650 --> 19:26.260
There's no time!

19:26.340 --> 19:27.630
What should we do Atom?

19:27.630 --> 19:30.860
There must be...
There must be... some way...

19:31.820 --> 19:32.870
That's it!

19:56.470 --> 19:57.440
That's...

19:58.650 --> 20:00.450
The Captain-go's flag!

20:04.300 --> 20:05.300
Everyone!

20:05.730 --> 20:07.710
Denkou!

20:07.710 --> 20:09.250
Come back Denkou!

20:09.250 --> 20:10.940
Denkou!

20:11.030 --> 20:12.690
Denkou!

20:13.900 --> 20:14.960
Is he coming?

20:14.960 --> 20:16.390
No, don't see him!

20:16.660 --> 20:18.280
Oh no, it's hopeless!

20:18.280 --> 20:21.080
Ah! Over there, it's Denkou!

20:22.000 --> 20:23.490
Everyone!

21:07.980 --> 21:09.550
We did it!

21:12.700 --> 21:13.670
Now!

21:13.880 --> 21:14.930
Wait!

21:16.400 --> 21:18.850
Let the kids be.

21:27.610 --> 21:29.640
I'm so grateful, I'm at a loss for words.

21:29.800 --> 21:32.620
Thanks to you,
Denkou was rescued and returned.

21:32.620 --> 21:34.460
No, Professor Emil...

21:34.460 --> 21:37.290
Denkou was saved by these kids.

21:37.290 --> 21:39.070
Here! It's from all of us.

21:39.350 --> 21:40.750
What is it?

21:42.510 --> 21:44.510
Captain-go's flag!

21:45.040 --> 21:46.910
Is it really okay for me to take this?

21:46.940 --> 21:47.640
Yeah!

21:47.640 --> 21:49.300
Come again Denkou!

21:49.300 --> 21:51.670
Because I plan to improve the Captain-go.

21:51.670 --> 21:53.770
At that time, come again and we'll fly.

21:53.770 --> 21:56.260
Okay, everyone... Thank you!

21:58.560 --> 22:01.780
Bye! See you again. Denkou!

22:11.650 --> 22:17.180
Naze... Naze... Kokoro ga...
Why... Why... is my heart...

22:17.580 --> 22:22.790
Itamu to namida ni naru?
Is filled with pain and tears?

22:23.170 --> 22:28.680
Naze... Naze... Namida ga...
Why... Why... Tears...

22:28.960 --> 22:34.260
Ochiru to Hitori ni naru.
They fall and I'm alone.

22:34.620 --> 22:39.900
Chiisa na hiza kakae...
I hold my tiny knees...

22:40.380 --> 22:48.540
Tooku wo mata miageru.
And look up and far away.

22:48.940 --> 22:51.820
Hiroi... Hiroi...
Vast... Vast...

22:52.030 --> 23:00.030
Kono sora yori motto hiroi hazu da!
It has to be more wide than these skies!

23:00.620 --> 23:03.030
Takai... Takai...
High... High...

23:03.460 --> 23:11.740
Ano kumo yori motto takai hazu da!
It has to be higher than those clouds!

23:12.040 --> 23:16.770
Kimi no kokoro mo...
Your heart is...

23:23.420 --> 23:24.550
Oh no!

23:24.550 --> 23:27.860
At a robot farm large vegetables
are causing tremors.

23:28.000 --> 23:30.540
The dam breaks down and floods the farm.

23:31.000 --> 23:32.050
Next time:

23:32.050 --> 23:34.000
"Save the Robot Farm"

23:34.080 --> 23:36.640
With your heart, catch the future!
